\subsection{Definitions and mathematical statement}
\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
In the nearest-neighbor planar XY model below its physical inverse-temperature threshold $b_c$, does $\operatorname{sqrt}(b_c-b)$ log xi(b) converge to a finite strictly positive constant as b increases to $b_c$?

\subsection{Short English statement}
